  "answer": "As a manager at Northstar, your buddy and check-in tasks include assigning a buddy to the new hire and scheduling the first 30-day check-in during the onboarding period. Regarding new-hire equipment requests, the initiation is done by the HR Admin, and the fulfillment is handled by the IT Admin. The standard equipment bundle includes a laptop, charger, headset, keyboard, mouse, and monitor.",
